    title: ["Your privacy matters, get it back!","خصوصيتك تهم، استرجعها!","Deine Privatsphäre zählt. Hol sie dir zurück!","¡Tu privacidad importa, recupérala!","Votre vie privée compte. Reprenez-la en main !","Gizliliğiniz önemli. Onu geri alın!","你的隐私很重要，拿回掌控权！","소중한 개인정보, 다시 지키세요!","大切なプライバシーを取り戻そう！","Privasi anda penting. Ambil semula kawalan!"],
    intro: ["Get back to the original link with known trackers and sharing IDs removed.","ارجع للرابط الأصلي بعد إزالة أدوات التتبّع ومعرّفات المشاركة المعروفة.","Rufe den ursprünglichen Link ab und entferne bekannte Tracking- und Teilen-IDs.","Recupera el enlace original sin los rastreadores ni los identificadores de uso compartido conocidos.","Retrouvez le lien d’origine sans les traceurs ni les identifiants de partage connus.","Bilinen izleyicilerden ve paylaşım kimliklerinden arındırılmış asıl bağlantıyı alın.","移除已知的跟踪参数和分享标识，找回原始链接。","알려진 추적 매개변수와 공유 ID를 제거해 원본 링크를 되찾으세요.","既知の追跡パラメーターと共有 ID を削除して、元のリンクを取り戻しましょう。","Dapatkan pautan asal dengan membuang parameter penjejakan dan ID perkongsian yang diketahui."],
    original: ["Original link","الرابط الأصلي","Ursprünglicher Link","Enlace original","Lien d’origine","Orijinal bağlantı","原始链接","원본 링크","元のリンク","Pautan asal"],
